Made for You</h2>\n            <p>Every client has different needs and style preferences. Some like simple and modern interiors, while others prefer a luxury or classic look.</p>\n            <p>We first understand your space, lifestyle, budget, furniture needs, storage, lighting, colours, and preferred style. Based on these details, we create a design that fits your needs.</p>\n            <p>The goal is to make your space feel personal and easy to use.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <hr>\n\n        <!-- Residential Interior Design in Karnal -->\n        <section id=\"residential_design\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Residential Interior Design in Karnal</h2>\n            <p>A home should feel comfortable and welcoming.</p>\n            <p>We plan living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, dining areas, wardrobes, bathrooms, and other spaces according to the family's needs.</p>\n            <p>For smaller homes, smart storage and good furniture placement can help save space. Larger homes can include custom furniture, detailed lighting, stylish finishes, and larger living areas.</p>\n            <p>Every part of the home is planned to look good and remain useful.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <hr>\n\n        <!-- Office Interior Design -->\n        <section id=\"office_design\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Office Interior Design</h2>\n            <p>An office should make work easier and more comfortable.</p>\n            <p>The design can include workstations, cabins, meeting rooms, reception areas, storage, and common spaces.</p>\n            <p>Furniture, lighting, colours, and wall designs can also be planned to match the company's style.</p>\n            <p>A good office design should provide enough space for employees while keeping the workplace clean, comfortable, and professional.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <hr>\n\n        <!-- Salon Interior Design in Karnal -->\n        <section id=\"salon_design\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Salon Interior Design in Karnal</h2>\n            <p>A salon should look attractive and also work smoothly for customers and staff.</p>\n            <p>As a <a class=\"content-link\" href=\"/karnal/services-best-salon-interior-designer\" title=\"Best salon interior designer in Karnal\">best salon interior designer in Karnal</a>, 9th Corner focuses on planning reception areas, waiting spaces, styling stations, mirrors, wash areas, storage, furniture, and lighting.</p>\n            <p>Lighting is especially important in a salon. It should provide enough light for daily work while creating a comfortable feel for customers.</p>\n            <p>Colours, furniture, flooring, walls, mirrors, and brand elements can be planned together to create a clear and attractive salon look.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <hr>\n\n        <!-- Smart Use of Space -->\n        <section id=\"smart_use_of_space\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Smart Use of Space</h2>\n            <p>Good interior design is not only about decoration. It is also about using the available space correctly.</p>\n            <p>A small room can feel more open with the right furniture and storage. A large room can feel more comfortable when every area has a clear purpose.</p>\n            <p>We consider movement, furniture placement, storage, lighting, and daily use before adding decorative details.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <hr>\n\n        <!-- Why Choose a Top Interior Design Firm in Karnal? -->\n        <section id=\"why_top_firm\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Why Choose a Top Interior Design Firm in Karnal?</h2>\n            <p>Choosing the right design team can make your project easier.</p>\n            <p>A professional team can help with:</p>\n            <ul class=\"trend-list\">\n                <li>Better use of space</li>\n                <li>Furniture planning</li>\n                <li>Storage ideas</li>\n                <li>Lighting planning</li>\n                <li>Colour selection</li>\n                <li>Material selection</li>\n                <li>3D design views</li>\n                <li>Better project planning</li>\n                <li>Smooth execution</li>\n                <li>Designs based on your needs</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>For those looking for a <a class=\"content-link\" href=\"/karnal/services-top-interior-design-firm\" title=\"Top interior design firm in Karnal\">top interior design firm in Karnal</a>, 9th Corner focuses on understanding the client and creating spaces that are both beautiful and useful.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <hr>\n\n        <!-- Local Project Snapshot -->\n        <section id=\"project_snapshot\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Local Project Snapshot</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"snapshot-grid\">\n                <div class=\"snapshot-card\">\n                    <img width=\"2500\" height=\"1899\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/img/project/mr-umesh-jain-bhivani/mr-umesh-jain-bhivani/v1.avif\" alt=\"Living room of the Mr Umesh Jain residence in Bhiwani, Haryana, designed by 9th Corner\" title=\"Living room of the Mr Umesh Jain residence in Bhiwani, Haryana, designed by 9th Corner\">\n                    <div class=\"snapshot-card-body\">\n                        <h3>A Bhiwani Home</h3>\n                        <a href=\"/karnal/umesh-residence-interior-design\" title=\"View this residential interior design project in Bhiwani\">View project</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"snapshot-card\">\n                    <img width=\"2500\" height=\"1853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/img/project/mr-vijay-singh-sonipat/mr-vijay-singh-sonipat/507.avif\" alt=\"Bedroom of the Mr Vijay Singh residence in Sonipat, Haryana, designed by 9th Corner\" title=\"Bedroom of the Mr Vijay Singh residence in Sonipat, Haryana, designed by 9th Corner\">\n                    <div class=